    "Browser, desktop, CLI, extension, and host access for this account.": "查看并管理当前账号在浏览器、桌面端、CLI、扩展插件及各主机上的登录会话。",
    "What this host surfaces, and what its automation receives.": "配置当前主机向你展示的通知提醒，以及自动化钩子 (Hooks) 接收的事件。",
    "Sign-ins, keys and tools for each coding agent, on every computer and sandbox running Personal.": "管理各编程智能体的账号登录、API 密钥与工具（同步至所有运行「个人环境」的电脑与沙箱）。",
    "Model Context Protocol servers, per provider.": "按编程智能体分别配置可调用的 MCP (Model Context Protocol) 服务器。",
    "Skills installed into a provider.": "安装并启用到该编程智能体中的技能包 (Skills)。",
    "Per-provider environment overrides.": "仅对该服务商生效的环境变量覆盖设置。",
    "When a rate limit, outage, billing problem or signed-out account interrupts your chat, Traycer can carry it on to another account or an equivalent model instead of ending it.": "当遇到速率限制、服务故障、额度不足或账号掉线中断对话时，Traycer 可自动切换到备用账号或同级别等效模型继续对话。",
    "How Traycer launches terminals, the host, and provider harnesses.": "配置 Traycer 启动内置终端、后台服务与各编程智能体时使用的默认终端与环境变量。",
    "Host environment · After restart": "主机环境变量 · 重启主机服务后生效",
    "A script each computer runs to set itself up: once when it first gets your settings, and again when you change it.": "每台电脑在首次同步你的配置或脚本更新时自动执行的初始化脚本。",
    "Who is in this team and what each person can change.": "查看当前团队成员列表及其对应的配置修改权限。",
    "Desktop runtime and diagnostics details.": "桌面端运行环境与诊断详情。",
    "Desktop and host diagnostics.": "桌面客户端与后台主机诊断信息。",
    "Lists every JS heap in this window: the page and each worker it runs. A heap snapshot covers the page only, so this is what accounts for the rest. Embedder and backing sit outside the JS heap — Blink's own objects, and ArrayBuffer/WebAssembly stores such as a highlighter worker's regex engine.": "列出当前窗口中的所有 JS 堆内存（包括主页面及其运行的各个 Worker 线程）。堆快照仅包含主页面，其余内存由下表统计；Embedder 与 Backing 代表 JS 堆外的 Blink 对象及 ArrayBuffer/WebAssembly 内存（如代码高亮引擎）。",
    "One cloud sandbox hosts the team's bots, using the team's credit while it runs.": "使用一个共享的云端沙箱托管团队的所有机器人（运行期间消耗团队额度）。",
