    "Paste your provider API key when asked (DeepSeek by default).": "出现提示时粘贴你的服务商 API 密钥（默认为 DeepSeek）。",
    "Refresh this list.": "刷新此列表。",
    "Choose “Set up in terminal” from a chat's model picker or the start page's. It opens Reasonix's setup wizard on the host that composer runs on.": "从对话或开始页面的模型选择器中选择“在终端中设置”。这将在输入框所在的主机上打开 Reasonix 设置向导。",
    "Open a chat and choose “Set up in terminal” from its model picker. This host's version can open Reasonix's setup wizard from a chat, but not from the start page.": "打开一个对话并从其模型选择器中选择“在终端中设置”。此主机版本支持从对话中打开 Reasonix 设置向导，但不支持从开始页面打开。",
    "Reasonix asks for your provider API key in that terminal. Finish there, then use Refresh above.": "Reasonix 会在该终端中请求你的服务商 API 密钥。请在终端中完成设置，然后点击上方的“刷新”。",
    "Choose your inference provider from the list in that terminal.": "在该终端的列表中选择你的推理服务商。",
    "Give that provider an API key when Hermes asks for one.": "当 Hermes 提示时，输入该服务商的 API 密钥。",
    "Choose “Set up in terminal” from a chat's model picker or the start page's. It opens Hermes' setup wizard on the host that composer runs on.": "从对话或开始页面的模型选择器中选择“在终端中设置”。这将在输入框所在的主机上打开 Hermes 设置向导。",
    "Open a chat and choose “Set up in terminal” from its model picker. This host's version can open Hermes' setup wizard from a chat, but not from the start page.": "打开一个对话并从其模型选择器中选择“在终端中设置”。此主机版本支持从对话中打开 Hermes 设置向导，但不支持从开始页面打开。",
    "Hermes asks for an inference provider and its API key in that terminal. Finish there, then use Refresh above.": "Hermes 会在该终端中询问推理服务商及其 API 密钥。请在终端中完成设置，然后点击上方的“刷新”。",
    "Qwen Code opens in that terminal. Type /auth and complete the sign-in there, then use Refresh above.": "Qwen Code 会在该终端中打开。请在其中输入 /auth 并完成登录，然后点击上方的“刷新”。",
    "Follow the sign-in prompt Droid shows when it starts.": "按照 Droid 启动时显示的登录提示操作。",
    "Droid opens in that terminal and prompts you to sign in. Complete it there, then use Refresh above.": "Droid 会在该终端中打开并提示你登录。请在终端中完成登录，然后点击上方的“刷新”。",
    "Type login followed by the provider (for example login anthropic) in that terminal and follow the prompts.": "在该终端中输入 login 加服务商名称（例如 login anthropic），然后按照提示操作。",
    "Kilo Code asks for the provider and sign-in method in that terminal. Complete it there, then use Refresh above.": "Kilo Code 会在该终端中询问服务商和登录方式。请在终端中完成登录，然后点击上方的“刷新”。",
    "Open the link that terminal prints — on your own computer Amp may open it for you — then follow it through and answer whatever the terminal asks for next.": "打开该终端打印的链接（在你自己的电脑上，Amp 可能会自动为你打开），完成网页端操作并根据终端接下来的提示进行回复。",
    "Amp prints a sign-in link and waits in that terminal. Finish there, then use Refresh above.": "Amp 会在该终端中打印登录链接并等待。请在终端中完成操作，然后点击上方的“刷新”。",
    "Choose a sign-in method in that terminal, then follow what it shows — for a social account that is a link to open and a code to confirm.": "在该终端中选择一种登录方式，并按照显示的步骤操作——如果使用社交账号，则需要打开链接并确认验证码。",
    "Kiro asks which account to use in that terminal, then walks you through that account's sign-in. Finish there, then use Refresh above.": "Kiro 会在该终端中询问要使用的账号，并引导你完成该账号的登录。请在终端中完成操作，然后点击上方的“刷新”。",
    "Finish the sign-in in the browser page that terminal opens, on the computer it runs on.": "在该终端运行所在的电脑上，通过终端打开的浏览器页面完成登录。",
    "Command Code opens its sign-in page in a browser on that computer and waits in the terminal. Finish there, then use Refresh above.": "Command Code 会在该电脑的浏览器中打开登录页面并在终端中等待。请完成登录，然后点击上方的“刷新”。",
    "Complete the sign-in in that terminal.": "在该终端中完成登录。",
