    "Does the spacing still work with long descriptions?": "描述较长时间距效果是否依然良好？",
    "Descriptions wrap beneath the title and keep a comfortable line length. Related details share one group, with more space between tasks than within them. This makes the hierarchy clear even when several rows contain multiple lines.": "描述会在标题下方自动换行并保持舒适的行宽。相关详情归为一组，任务之间的间距大于任务内部的间距。即使多行内容包含长文本，层级结构依然清晰。",
    "Keep the existing colours.": "保留现有配色。",
    "The update uses the existing theme tokens. Completion, focus and secondary text keep their current meanings across light and dark themes. No extra palette or separate set of styles is needed.": "此次更新沿用现有的主题变量。完成状态、焦点和次要文本在浅色与深色主题下保持原有语义，无需额外的调色板或独立样式。",
    "What is ready to review?": "有哪些内容可以开始审查？",
    "The task list has clearer grouping, responsive spacing, a useful empty state and a predictable keyboard order. One file changed, and the background check is running. This conversation and its counts are sample content for configuring your layout.": "任务列表现在具备更清晰的分组、响应式间距、实用的空状态以及可预期的键盘焦点顺序。已修改 1 个文件，后台检查正在运行。此对话及其统计数据均为用于配置布局的示例内容。",
    "The palette tokens already carry completion and focus in both themes, so nothing new is needed.": "现有的调色板变量在两种主题下均已涵盖完成状态与焦点样式，因此无需新增内容。",
