    "Git can't remove this worktree normally - its directory or metadata is missing or broken. Deleting it uses a forced cleanup.": "Git 无法正常移除此工作树 — 其目录或元数据已缺失或损坏。删除它将执行强制清理。",
    "The work is proven to have landed: a merged PR matches this worktree's current commit, the branch's commits are contained in the default branch, or authored submodule work from an otherwise at-base worktree is proven landed.": "此工作树的代码已确认合入：存在匹配当前提交的已合并 PR、分支提交已包含在默认分支中，或基准工作树中的子模块提交已确认合入。",
    "The worktree never advanced from the commit it was created on and has no uncommitted changes - deleting it loses no committed work.": "此工作树自创建以来未产生新提交，且没有未提交的修改 — 删除它不会丢失任何已提交的工作成果。",
